val12=$[$val6 + $val9]
val13=$[$val9-$val10]
val14=$[$val8+$val10]
val15=$[$val7+$val13]
val16=$[$val11+$val8]
val17=$[$val7*$val13]
val18=$[$val7*$val9]
val19=$[$val17-$val16]
val20=$[$val18-$val16]
val21=Un marchand de fruits de Cayenne achète $val9 kg de ramboutans à un producteur d'Iracoubo au prix de $val6 &euro; le kilogramme	et dépense $val8 &euro; pour les transporter. Il les vend au prix	de $val7&euro; le kilogramme; mais le ramboutan étant un produit périssable, il doit en jeter $val10 kg .	<p>Calcule le bénéfice réalisé par ce marchand de fruits.</p>	<ul><li>	Calcul du prix payé au producteur d'Iracoubo:?? $val6 x $val9 = $val11, $val6 + $val9 = $val12,$val9 - $val10 = $val13,$val8 + $val10 = $val14,$val11 + $val8 = $val16,$val7 x $val13 = $val17,$val17 - $val16 = $val19,$val7 + $val13 = $val15,$val7 x $val9 = $val18,$val18 - $val16 = $val20 ??&euro;.	</li><li>	Calcul du prix payé au producteur plus le transport:??$val11 + $val8 = $val16, $val6 x $val9 = $val11, $val6 + $val9 = $val12,$val9 - $val10 = $val13,$val8 + $val10 = $val14,$val7 x $val13 = $val17,$val17 - $val16 = $val19,$val7 + $val13 = $val15,$val7 x $val9 = $val18,$val18 - $val16 = $val20 ??&euro;.	</li><li>	Calcul du nombre de kg vendu:??$val9 - $val10 = $val13,$val11 + $val8 = $val16, $val6 x $val9 = $val11, $val6 + $val9 = $val12,$val8 + $val10 = $val14,$val7 x $val13 = $val17,$val17 - $val16 = $val19,$val7 + $val13 = $val15,$val7 x $val9 = $val18,$val18 - $val16= $val20?? kg.	</li><li>	Calcul de la recette:??$val7 x $val13 = $val17,$val9 - $val10 = $val13,$val11 + $val8 = $val16, $val6 x $val9 = $val11, $val6 + $val9 = $val12,$val8 + $val10 = $val14,$val17 - $val16 = $val19,$val7 + $val13 = $val15,$val7 x $val9 = $val18,$val18 - $val16 = $val20 ??&euro;.	</li><li>	Calcul du bénéfice:??$val17 - $val16 = $val19,$val9 - $val10 = $val13,$val11 + $val8 = $val16, $val6 x $val9 = $val11, $val6 + $val9 = $val12,$val8 + $val10 = $val14,$val7 x $val13 = $val17,$val7 + $val13 = $val15,$val7 x $val9 = $val18,$val18 - $val16 = $val20??&euro;.	</li></ul>	
